# MirageOS sample unikernel (#403): `mirage configure` generates a Makefile,
# dune files, main.ml, dist/, duniverse/, a lockfile and a `disk` image — none
# of which belong in git. Track only the hand-written sources + README.
mirage/*
!mirage/config.ml
!mirage/unikernel.ml
!mirage/README.md
